[17592186671776 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671782 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671776 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671786 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671776 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671792 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671776 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671800 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671776 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671776 1077 "selection" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671776 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671800 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671776 1079 #uuid "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671777 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671777 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671777 1083 #uuid "32919808-37f3-50f9-84d3-fbc5f4e790be" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671778 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2y-6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671778 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671778 1083 #uuid "34af56ad-6e01-5418-9bbd-444996023af2" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671779 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-9y-3 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671779 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671779 1083 #uuid "34c7e84b-f840-570a-bcc7-3dc041afa01e" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671780 1068 #edb/ref 17592186671773 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671780 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671780 1071 "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+7y &=-2 \\\\ 6x+42y &=-12.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system." 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671780 1072 #uuid "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671780 1074 "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 42 & -12\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 42 & -12\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-6{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+7y &=-2 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx+7y=-2.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=-7y-2,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-7y-2 \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-7y-2 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671781 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y-6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671781 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538677 17592186045443 true] [17592186671781 1083 #uuid "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be" 13194139538677